                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I played as a War clan, the problem is that you can never destroy other clans, even if you attack the same clan 100 times, they just spawn more troops. \nYou can not take their land\nSome actions are just for show, in reality you have only one options to progress it\nThere is not a clear progression system in the game.\nIt is just boring to play after maybe 2 hours\nPaid 0.90 Euros, I do not recommend it",
